{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/2411e4ccd945de4f71757c91fa3adafb.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What if opening Pandora\u2019s Box didn\u2019t end the story\u2026</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may know the myth - when Pandora opened the Box, all evils were released into the world.\u00a0But when all seemed lost, Hope remained.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you may not know is this:\u00a0From that Hope, she left behind a daughter...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pyrrha</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/38e370cf8283a9fd5d14a511fdab6b4c.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/10d15f63ec71e6a90d8a2c3533496507.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Legacy of Pandora, you play as Pyrrha</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will tame strange and powerful monsters called Kakodemons, battle mortals and gods alike, explore a world shaped by ancient Greek myths, and face events where every decision leaves a mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can capture Kakodemons in battle. But be careful not to strike too hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/3626cc30df36af720aa9972e2aa01e1d.poster.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/3626cc30df36af720aa9972e2aa01e1d.webm?t=1769078579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/3626cc30df36af720aa9972e2aa01e1d.mp4?t=1769078579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No Levels. No Traditional Evolution</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is <strong>no XP grind </strong>here.\u00a0Your monsters evolve through <strong>Corruption</strong>, shaped by your actions and moral choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through myth-inspired events with multiple outcomes, your choices will earn you different kinds of corruption:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Violence</strong> \u2022 <strong>Madness</strong> \u2022 <strong>Sorrow</strong> \u2022 <strong>Death</strong> \u2022 <strong>Greed</strong> \u2022 <strong>Disease</strong> \u2022\u00a0 <strong>Hope</strong> \u2022 <strong>Pride</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/2434a26e93c6017aaeff7f36a1e8e0db.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1560 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/ed2814e95eed74233a40286296948a4e.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters That Reflect You</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The same creature can become something entirely different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A double-headed serpent corrupted by <strong>Greed</strong> may grow into a <strong>Hydra</strong>, its heads locked in endless conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another, twisted by\u00a0<strong>Disease</strong>, may rise as a corrupted\u00a0<strong>Caduceus</strong>\u00a0- once a symbol of healing, now sick and rusted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.poster.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.webm?t=1769078579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/abc7ade8e6fe1c3b436cd2d6c5d2b4a4.mp4?t=1769078579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path leads to\u00a0<strong>radically different forms</strong>\u00a0 - there is no \u201ccorrect\u201d evolution, only a reflection of the path you take.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/f5d6124e3f3346dcb023b115e3f077c3.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brain beats Brawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>turn-based </strong>and<strong> deeply strategic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Kakodemon has strengths and weaknesses -\u00a0choosing the wrong one can cost you the run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may raise many creatures\u2026\u00a0Or\u00a0<strong>sacrifice</strong>\u00a0<strong>them</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0<i>strengthen</i>\u00a0a single one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/43277da31b42d8a06a9000b8620e1e60.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1560 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>Flames of Will</strong>, earned in battle and sacrifice, you customize every Kakodemon build:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>Stats</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Skills</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define combat roles (DPS, support, tank, healer);</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players may catch the same creature but end up with entirely different monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/b783f16b85e856e06b1229559146c2c5.avif?t=1769078579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/b783f16b85e856e06b1229559146c2c5.webp?t=1769078579 width=1560 height=889 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/9ee1e3e82a19fe2c0bb2bbf0ea6a2a43.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two teams are the same. No two stories repeat. Shape YOUR own myth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now. Demo coming soon.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3973310?t=1769078579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/916a88c084632941e7c049330932131332b20423/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769078579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/28f7b6029ffd2286f51ea0fcc98b5703226527ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769078579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/28f7b6029ffd2286f51ea0fcc98b5703226527ce/capsule_1