ats Brawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is <strong>turn-based </strong>and<strong> deeply strategic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Kakodemon has strengths and weaknesses -\u00a0choosing the wrong one can cost you the run...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may raise many creatures\u2026\u00a0Or\u00a0<strong>sacrifice</strong>\u00a0<strong>them</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0<i>strengthen</i>\u00a0a single one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/43277da31b42d8a06a9000b8620e1e60.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1560 height=890 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>Flames of Will</strong>, earned in battle and sacrifice, you customize every Kakodemon build:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invest in <strong>Stats</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Skills</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define combat roles (DPS, support, tank, healer);</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two players may catch the same creature but end up with entirely different monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/b783f16b85e856e06b1229559146c2c5.avif?t=1769078579\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras_big/b783f16b85e856e06b1229559146c2c5.webp?t=1769078579 width=1560 height=889 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973310/extras/9ee1e3e82a19fe2c0bb2bbf0ea6a2a43.avif?t=1769078579\" width=1386 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No two teams are the same. No two stories re